  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Western Balkans Integrated Border Management Facility (WBIBM)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the intervention is to support the authorities in the Western Balkans to effectively manage their borders and respond to border security challenges, through a righst-based approach and mindful of migrant protection principles. This is done, among other things, through development of relevant policy/operational guidelines on humanitarian border management, development of fundamental rights monitoring and compliance mechanisms at international borders, and facilitating the adoption and implementation of international standards related to passenger data.</narrative>
  </description>
